data: {"id": "81ae9abc0e924c06-thinking-parallel_evidence-255", "run_id": "81ae9abc0e924c06", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将基于已采集的可观测性 baseline 继续执行 kubectl 诊断。\n\n## 已采集事实汇总\n\n### Metrics（prometheus）\n- `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` = 1\n- `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}` = 1\n- 重启次数 = 0，无 Running/Succeeded/Failed\n- Pod UID: `9de01e2a-aa28-4619-947b-d99f9a8a8897`，节点: node2\n\n### Logging（elasticsearch）\n- 最近30分钟无日志记录 → **empty**。容器未启动，预期结果。\n\n### Tracing（deepflow+tempo）\n- pod_ip 为空，无法执行 DeepFlow flow 查询 → **absent**。沙箱未建成，预期。\n\n---\n\n接下来执行 `kubectl_describe`、`kubectl_get_yam", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789046218962, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

