data: {"id": "81ae9abc0e924c06-thinking-parallel_evidence-679", "run_id": "81ae9abc0e924c06", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|------|------|\n| **Pod 状态** | Pending / ContainerCreating，无 Running |\n| **Events** | `FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（17次，持续20分钟） |\n| **Pod YAML** | `volumes[0].configMap.name = \"unavailable-config\"`，`Optional: false` |\n| **Topology** | 被 ReplicaSet/workload-5b5fc86c8c 拥有，调度到 node2，容器 app |\n| **Metrics** | `waiting_reason=ContainerCreating`, phase=Pending, restarts=0 |\n| **Previous logs** | 无（从未", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789046226401, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

